::recipe

name: Shakshouka
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/shakshouka/
source author: jakub-korsak
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: source
category: breakfast
tags: eggs, tomato, shakshouka
dietary: vegetarian
serves: 2
active time: ~10m
total time: ~20m
image: shakshouka.webp

::ingredients

(tomato, small) 5
(egg) 5
(onion; white, peeled) 1
(chives) some
(cumin) to taste
(powdered sweet pepper) to taste

# Used by the method but omitted from the source ingredient list.
(oil) as needed
(salt) to taste

::equipment

(frying pan)
(lid)

::instructions

(tomato) <scald, to loosen skin>
    <peel>
    <cut, cubes>

(onion) <chop>
    <glaze, frying pan, oil>

{shakshouka} =
    (onion) +
    (tomato)

{shakshouka} <season, cumin + powdered sweet pepper + salt>
    <stir>
    <cook, until denser>
    + (egg)
    <season>
    <cover, lid>
    <cook, until eggs are set>
    + (chives)
    <serve>
